  "Notes": [
    {
      "Text": "Security update for python-tornado",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for python-tornado fixes the following issues\n\n- CVE-2026-49853: authorization header forwarded across cross-origin redirects in SimpleAsyncHTTPClient (bsc#1268395).\n- CVE-2026-49854: out-of-bounds memory access via C extension (bsc#1268396).\n- CVE-2026-49855: AsyncHTTPClient accumulates decompressed chunks without size limit (bsc#1268397).\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
    },
